---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import documents from '../../data/documents.json';
import DocLinks from '../../components/DocLinks.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Beth Rydym yn ei Wario" title_en="What We Spend">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Beth Rydym yn ei Wario</span><span lang="en">What We Spend</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/the-council/"><span lang="cy">Y Cyngor</span><span lang="en">The Council</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Beth Rydym yn ei Wario</span><span lang="en">What We Spend</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Tryloywder Ariannol</span><span lang="en">Financial Transparency</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan yn ymrwymedig i fod yn agored am ei wariant. Yn unol â'r Ddeddf Llywodraeth Leol a'r Mesur Llywodraeth Leol (Cymru) 2011, mae'r cyngor yn cyhoeddi gwybodaeth am ei gyllid.</p>
    <p lang="en">Llansannan Community Council is committed to being open about its spending. In accordance with the Local Government Act and the Local Government (Wales) Measure 2011, the council publishes information about its finances.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Praesept</span><span lang="en">Precept</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Mae'r cyngor yn codi praesept ar Gyngor Conwy bob blwyddyn i ariannu ei weithgareddau. Amlinellir y praesept yn y gyllideb flynyddol sy'n cael ei chymeradwyo mewn cyfarfod cyhoeddus.</p>
    <p lang="en">The council raises a precept from Conwy Council each year to fund its activities. The precept is outlined in the annual budget which is approved at a public meeting.</p>

    <div class="minutes-list">
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Cyllideb 2026/27 a Phraesept</span><span lang="en">2026/27 Budget and Precept</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Cymeradwywyd</span><span lang="en">Approved</span></div>
        </div>
        <DocLinks doc={documents.what_we_spend} />
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-sh" style="margin-top:2rem"><span lang="cy">Taliadau</span><span lang="en">Payments</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Gweler tudalen taliadau'r cynghorwyr am wybodaeth am daliadau unigol dros £100.</p>
    <p lang="en">See the councillors' payments page for information on individual payments over £100.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="/councillors/payments/"><span lang="cy">Taliadau Cynghorwyr →</span><span lang="en">Councillors' Payments →</span></a>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      <a href="/the-council/annual-return/"><span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol →</span><span lang="en">Annual Return →</span></a>
    </p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
